# 🛒 ShopHub — C# E-Commerce Management System

A console-based **E-Commerce Management System** built with C# to practice and demonstrate core and advanced C# concepts through a single real-world project.

The project simulates an online shopping system where customers can browse products, create orders, manage stock, complete purchases, and analyze product/order data.

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

**ShopHub** is designed as a practical C# project that combines multiple programming concepts into one interconnected system.

Instead of implementing each C# topic separately, the project uses them together in a realistic E-Commerce architecture.

### Main Features

* 👤 Customer Management
* 📦 Product Management
* 🛍️ Order Management
* 🔎 Product Search
* 📊 LINQ-based Statistics
* 📦 Stock Management
* 🗑️ Soft Delete / Restore
* ⚠️ Custom Exception Handling
* 🧩 Generic Repository
* 🗂️ Custom Collection
* 🔍 Reflection
* 🧠 Garbage Collection
* 🧱 OOP Architecture
* 🔌 Interfaces
* 🧬 Inheritance
* 🧩 Abstract Classes
* 🛠️ Extension Methods
* 🔢 Indexers
* 🔄 ref / out Parameters

