# 🗂️ Custom Collection

The project contains a custom generic collection:

```text
CustomCollection<T>
```

### Requirements

The implementation uses a raw array:

```text
T[] _items
```

`List<T>` is not used internally.

### Operations

```text
Add()
Remove()
Get()
Contains()
Clear()
Count
```

When the array becomes full, its capacity is manually increased.

This demonstrates how collection structures work internally.

