# 🧠 Garbage Collection

The project includes a `MemoryTest` utility for observing .NET memory management.

The application creates a large number of objects such as:

```text
100,000 OrderItem
```

Memory information can then be compared before and after object creation.

Used APIs include:

```text
GC.GetTotalMemory()
GC.GetGeneration()
GC.Collect()
GC.GetAllocatedBytesForCurrentThread()
```

