# 🔄 Order Flow

The main shopping flow is:

```text
Customer
    ↓
Create Order
    ↓
Add Product
    ↓
Select Quantity
    ↓
Check Stock
    ↓
Calculate Price
    ↓
Reduce Stock
    ↓
Confirm Order
    ↓
Shipped
    ↓
Delivered
```

Before confirming an order, the system validates:

* Customer exists
* Order exists
* Order contains products
* Product exists
* Product is not deleted
* Stock is sufficient
* Total price is calculated
* Stock is reduced
* Order status is updated

